msgid "S2J Slug Generater"
msgstr "S2J Slug Generater"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: s2j-slug-generater.php
msgid "https://github.com/stein2nd/s2j-slug-generater"
msgstr "https://github.com/stein2nd/s2j-slug-generater"

#. Description of the plugin
#: s2j-slug-generater.php
msgid ""
"Generate optimal slug candidates using translation service APIs. Supports "
"both Gutenberg block editor and Classic editor."
msgstr ""
"翻訳サービスの API を使用して、最適なスラッグ候補を生成します。Gutenberg ブ"
"ロックエディターとクラシックエディターの両方をサポートしています。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: s2j-slug-generater.php
msgid "Koutarou ISHIKAWA"
msgstr "Koutarou ISHIKAWA"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: s2j-slug-generater.php
msgid "https://stein2nd.wordpress.com"
msgstr "https://stein2nd.wordpress.com"

